      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\cos'x=-\\sin x$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "求驻点. 因为在闭区间$[-\\pi,\\pi]$上，只有在$x=-\\pi$，$x=0$",
        "和$x=\\pi$这些点，$\\sin x=0$，所以这些点是驻点（因为它们是余",
        "弦定义域内部的点）. 函数的上升和下降情况表示在下面的",
